{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chirax </strong>is on a mission to save stolen hydra hatchlings from knights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chirax</strong>, being a <strong>hydra</strong>, can grow up to 3 heads at once and launch them at her foes! \u00a0She also functions as the health bar herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798540/extras/8936e53c3676a8953fe088e6e48f1313.poster.avif?t=1764912462\" width=304 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798540/extras/8936e53c3676a8953fe088e6e48f1313.webm?t=1764912462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform </strong>your way through <strong>six worlds</strong> all with a <strong>cute hand-drawn pixel art style</strong>, and fight <strong>eight unique bosses</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find cool <strong>power-ups </strong>and <strong>abilities</strong>! \u00a0Later on, you can find a power-up that allows Chirax to turn her heads into platforms! \u00a0You'll find blocks that make her heads also act like grappling hooks. \u00a0Sometimes, you can even launch Chirax's heads into the background!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A New Adventure!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3798540/b505fd26c30f146c53028270488c2ddc7d622a7f.jpg"},{"name":"Ghostbusted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3798540/04a453f9460652e99bcd82d02103c44a51c6d49b.jpg"},{"name":"Gardener","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3798540/69d16753975d912383072ad7b9bcff9bad7b0eba.jpg"},{"name":"Loose S